OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, helping clear way for $110bn
OL,5,Amerger with Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FParamount Skydance has settled a
OL,8,Flawsuit with dozens of US states,
OL,9,Fremoving a major hurdle to its $110bn
OL,10,F(#82.8bn) merger with Warner Bros
OL,11,FDiscovery.
OL,13,FCalifornia Attorney General Rob Bonta
OL,14,Ftold a news conference that state
OL,15,Fofficials agreed to terms after
OL,16,Fsecuring commitments to protect
OL,17,Fcompetition across film and television,
OL,18,Fand broadcasting.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
