OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, helping clear way for $110bn
OL,5,Amerger with Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FStill, "the settlement is not a vote of
OL,8,Fsupport for this merger," Bonta said.
OL,9,F"It is not a blessing of the broader
OL,10,Fmerger."
OL,12,FDavid Ellison, the company's chief, has
OL,13,Fthreatened to move studio operations
OL,14,Fout of California.
